#=GF CC   SAM-I-IV variant riboswitch is part of the clan CL00012 (SAM-I, SAM-IV and
#=GF CC   SAM-I-IV) which share a common SAM binding core. It is found upstream of a
#=GF CC   number of genes which code for proteins involved in methionine or cysteine
#=GF CC   biosynthesis. It has been found mostly in the order Actinomycetales [1].
